      "receiptSource": "Original Receipt in \u0027\u003Ci\u003EThe Art of Cookery, Made Plain and Easy\u003C/i\u003E\u0027 by Hannah Glasse, 1747 (\u003Ca href=\u0022references.html#glasse-1747\u0022\u003E\u003Cb\u003EGlasse 1747\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/a\u003E);",
      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003ETo make a barley soup.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\nTAKE a gallon of water, half a pound of barley, a blade or two of mace, a large crust of bread, a little lemon-peel. Let it boil till it comes to two quarts, then add half a pint of white wine, and sweeten to your palate.\u003Cbr\u003E"
